WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A recording says one syllable. The lips appear to say another.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In 1976, researchers described listeners reporting a third sound.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The trick is not that ears fail. The brain normally uses both sight and hearing.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Later studies found the effect depends on people, stimuli and presentation.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
And none of that proves a meditation recording improves your mind.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Check the source. Try a free routine. Decide what the product actually offers.
